  "description": "Station stops on the track network (the network counterpart of station-stop.json and of the train-length rules of station-facilities.json, ARCHITECTURE decision 51). Nodes a (1024, 2048) to f (6144, 2048) a tile apart, straight edges e1 to e5 of 1024, dead ends at both ends. Stations are points with platforms on edges: Central e1 [512, 1024], Market e3 [0, 512] and Hill e3 [512, 1024], which meet at 512, Terminal all of e5; Field has none until one is added on e4 [512, 1024]. A train stops for a platform it fits (cars - 1 tiles no longer than the platform) with its head at the far end the way it travels (the end going forward, length - start going backward); pathToStation is the shortest exact distance to such a berth (the rest of the train's edge, the edges between, the stretch into the last; no end when the berth is an edge's end). From a, going east: Central 1024, Market e2, e3 to 512 (2560), Hill e2, e3 (3072), Terminal 5120 also for 2 cars; none to Field, to an unknown station, to Central for 2 cars (its 512 is too short), to Market from 600 along e3 (behind), or from facing a's dead end; to Hill from 600 along e3 the rest of e3 (424); from Field's berth itself an empty path of 0. A train is stopped at a station when its path is spent (no edges left, its head where the path ends: the end of its edge without an end) and its head is on the station's platform on its edge, ends included; both stations where two platforms meet. Placing at a berth stops a train, and the edge it stands on cannot be removed (trackEdgeInUse, checked before trackEdgeHasPlatform, which keeps e3); reversing clears its path and the path's end, so a train reversed at the end of e1 is not stopped there (it would run on to a) until a path ending where it stands (end 0) is set; a new path ends the stop, even at rate 0; unplacing ends it. Local 2 passing Central's platform, or on Market's short of where its path ends, is not stopped; stopped at 512 on e3 it is at Market and Hill, beside both with its whole length, and stays stopped as time passes. Stopped at the end of e4, it is at Field once Field's platform is added there. A train of two cars at Terminal's berth lies along its platform; at Central's berth it is stopped there, but its tail is off the 512 of platform, so not beside it with its whole length. Cars cost nothing here. setTrainCars checks unknownTrain, then 1 to 16 cars (invalidTrainLength), then that the train is off the track (trainAlreadyPlaced).",
